1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 9=

8
00:01:00,939 --> 00:01:03,299
Don't drink so much
from now on, my dear.

9
00:01:03,659 --> 00:01:04,659
Let me carry you to bed.

10
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Freeze.

11
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:31,400
It's not him.

12
00:01:40,299 --> 00:01:43,340
(Good thing I hid my primordial spirit
in Cuicui's sea of consciousness.)

13
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:45,079
(She didn't notice anything.)

14
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:47,540
(But if I use
primordial spirit power again,)

15
00:01:47,980 --> 00:01:49,379
(she'll completely lock onto me.)

16
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:51,799
(That would be disastrous.)

17
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:57,980
(The Immortal Realm
oversees three thousand worlds.)

18
00:01:58,480 --> 00:02:00,480
(He is hiding in this very realm.)

19
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:03,819
(I'm getting closer to you.)

20
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:23,360
Hanyan, sleep in the thatched shed
with me tonight.

21
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:25,379
You two sleep in the room.

22
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,000
I...

23
00:02:28,340 --> 00:02:29,819
I can't.

24
00:02:30,419 --> 00:02:31,900
I haven't prepared myself yet.

25
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:36,360
Don't worry. I won't touch you tonight.

26
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:38,199
Just want to have a good talk

27
00:02:38,379 --> 00:02:39,379
and catch up on life.

28
00:02:42,639 --> 00:02:43,819
All right then.

29
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:48,900
Dong, I want to have a good talk too.

30
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:52,039
Why don't the three of us go together?

31
00:02:53,479 --> 00:02:55,400
(Lust will be the death of you.)

32
00:02:56,580 --> 00:02:59,479
There are things I only want
to discuss privately with Hanyan.

33
00:02:59,780 --> 00:03:01,780
As for you, some other day.

34
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:07,919
I'll do whatever you say, Dong.

35
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,240
Zhao Dong.

36
00:03:19,460 --> 00:03:20,460
Zhao Dong.

37
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:21,979
I know you're a lecher.

38
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:25,919
As long as you help me,

39
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:29,120
I can gather
all the beauties in the realm for you.

40
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,900
I can even give you the entire harem.

41
00:03:32,719 --> 00:03:34,080
It seems you still don't get it.

42
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,719
I only care for my wives.

43
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,360
As for other women,

44
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:40,780
I won't even spare them a glance.

45
00:03:41,939 --> 00:03:42,939
Zhao Dong, you...

46
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,139
Your enemies will come.

47
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:46,939
When that happens,
I won't lift a finger for an outsider.

48
00:03:47,699 --> 00:03:48,740
If you're smart,

49
00:03:49,340 --> 00:03:50,780
you'd better find a place to hide.

50
00:03:52,139 --> 00:03:53,319
Then cure my poison first.

51
00:03:55,379 --> 00:03:56,919
Wait till the poison hits.

52
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:58,879
It's late. Wash up and go to sleep.

53
00:03:58,879 --> 00:04:01,439
By the way, we're out of water.

54
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:03,020
If you need water,

55
00:04:03,620 --> 00:04:06,460
go draw it yourself from the old well
ten li out of town.

56
00:04:06,460 --> 00:04:07,460
You...

57
00:04:09,919 --> 00:04:10,919
Let's go.

58
00:04:13,860 --> 00:04:14,860
(Ridiculous!)

59
00:04:15,319 --> 00:04:16,480
(Treating me like this?)

60
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:18,100
(What an utter humiliation!)

61
00:04:32,259 --> 00:04:34,339
D... Dong.

62
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:38,060
Come sit here, my dear.

63
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,519
Look at me.

64
00:04:59,980 --> 00:05:00,980
I've divined

65
00:05:01,620 --> 00:05:04,180
that your father
is currently suffering in prison.

66
00:05:04,620 --> 00:05:05,620
Am I right?

67
00:05:10,740 --> 00:05:11,740
Yes.

68
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:17,399
My father was the Chief Clerk
of the Bureau of Personnel in Huainan.

69
00:05:17,740 --> 00:05:20,279
Simply for refusing
to curry favor with the powerful,

70
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,000
he was framed on false charges,

71
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:25,180
dismissed, and our house
was confiscated.

72
00:05:25,180 --> 00:05:27,339
I was also cast into the base register

73
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,500
and exiled here.

74
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,980
Don't worry, my dear.

75
00:05:35,579 --> 00:05:37,500
Though Huainan is thousands of li away,

76
00:05:38,139 --> 00:05:41,680
I can show you
his current state right now.

77
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:45,560
Is that true?

78
00:05:48,139 --> 00:05:49,180
Boundless sky,

79
00:05:49,819 --> 00:05:50,819
mirror across land,

80
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,019
shatter the void.

81
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,139
By my decree,

82
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,480
reveal!

83
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:04,060
Father! Father!

84
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,240
Dong...

85
00:06:14,699 --> 00:06:17,000
My father...

86
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:23,300
Don't worry.

87
00:06:23,740 --> 00:06:24,879
I will save your father,

88
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:26,399
have him restored to his post,

89
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:29,800
and even rise to the pinnacle of power.

90
00:06:31,379 --> 00:06:35,160
But they are just too powerful

91
00:06:35,399 --> 00:06:36,439
to be shaken.

92
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:41,680
I'm afraid you'll
be put in mortal danger because of this.

93
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,924
(Affection: 90)

94
00:06:47,660 --> 00:06:50,579
You are my lawfully wedded wife.

95
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,860
So your father is my father-in-law.

96
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:56,699
And your grievances are my grievances.

97
00:06:57,779 --> 00:06:58,779
Protecting you

98
00:06:58,879 --> 00:06:59,879
and sharing your burdens

99
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:01,439
is my duty as a husband.

100
00:07:03,439 --> 00:07:04,439
If they are a mountain,

101
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,480
I'll level the mountain.

102
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:08,500
If they are the sky,

103
00:07:08,740 --> 00:07:09,920
I'll shatter the sky.

104
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:14,339
All I want is for you
to never shed another tear,

105
00:07:15,540 --> 00:07:17,060
and never suffer any more injustice.

106
00:07:21,379 --> 00:07:22,379
Dong...

107
00:07:24,060 --> 00:07:27,579
How lucky I am
to have met you in this lifetime.

108
00:07:28,459 --> 00:07:31,839
Even if you can't
rescue my father or clear his name,

109
00:07:32,860 --> 00:07:34,240
I have no complaints or regrets.

110
00:07:35,420 --> 00:07:37,639
I only wish for your safety.

111
00:07:40,579 --> 00:07:41,579
Yan,

112
00:07:41,660 --> 00:07:42,720
I will surely deliver

113
00:07:43,939 --> 00:07:45,060
what I promised you.

114
00:07:47,620 --> 00:07:48,620
Dong,

115
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:51,920
I'll give myself to you right now.

116
00:07:55,759 --> 00:07:56,759
No rush.

117
00:07:58,060 --> 00:07:59,819
We'll do it after I rescue your father.

118
00:08:00,399 --> 00:08:01,399
No.

119
00:08:02,420 --> 00:08:06,160
I want to give myself to you completely
right now.

120
00:08:06,579 --> 00:08:07,920
I trust you.

121
00:08:20,740 --> 00:08:21,740
(Scoundrel!)

122
00:08:21,980 --> 00:08:23,620
(Lecher! Rascal!)

123
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:26,540
(You said you wouldn't touch her.
Chatting my foot.)

124
00:08:26,540 --> 00:08:27,560
(Full of lies!)

125
00:08:32,139 --> 00:08:34,179
Why aren't you asleep yet?

126
00:08:35,279 --> 00:08:36,460
How could I possibly sleep?

127
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:45,820
Xi Yun, what was your status before?

128
00:08:47,179 --> 00:08:51,360
You always talk like
you're above everyone else.

129
00:08:53,179 --> 00:08:56,820
You couldn't even begin
to imagine who I was.

130
00:08:57,759 --> 00:08:59,940
Whatever. It doesn't matter anyway.

131
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:02,960
With my invincible Dong here,

132
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:05,960
nothing frightens me anymore.

133
00:09:08,500 --> 00:09:09,500
I find it strange.

134
00:09:10,159 --> 00:09:11,879
Zhao Dong is just a broke rascal

135
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,639
who knows a few mystical tricks.

136
00:09:14,179 --> 00:09:15,480
Why do you trust him so much?

137
00:09:16,879 --> 00:09:17,879
Trying to fish for info?

138
00:09:18,159 --> 00:09:19,220
I'm not telling you!

139
00:09:19,659 --> 00:09:21,759
Dong has already divorced you anyway.

140
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:24,700
That's one less person
to share his love with.

141
00:09:26,519 --> 00:09:28,519
Su Wan'er, you...

142
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,580
(I am the supreme sovereign.)

143
00:09:33,899 --> 00:09:36,360
(When did I ever let such petty nobodies
get under my skin?)

144
00:09:37,139 --> 00:09:38,879
(Especially since I met Zhao Dong,)

145
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:41,379
(I haven't had
a single moment of peace.)

146
00:09:50,860 --> 00:09:52,179
(Heaven and earth in harmony,)

147
00:09:53,100 --> 00:09:54,620
(Yin and Yang in union.)

148
00:09:55,580 --> 00:09:57,240
(The earth receives the dew.)

149
00:09:58,059 --> 00:09:59,639
(The heaven bestows its grace.)

150
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,340
(Void Refinement stage.)

151
00:10:58,879 --> 00:11:00,000
(Body Integration stage.)

152
00:11:01,759 --> 00:11:02,940
(Mahayana stage.)

153
00:11:05,679 --> 00:11:06,860
(True Immortal stage.)

154
00:11:25,558 --> 00:11:29,149
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

155
00:11:29,149 --> 00:11:31,936
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

156
00:11:32,512 --> 00:11:34,674
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

157
00:11:34,674 --> 00:11:37,520
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

158
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:40,798
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

159
00:11:40,798 --> 00:11:42,432
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

160
00:11:42,432 --> 00:11:44,496
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

161
00:11:44,496 --> 00:11:46,032
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

162
00:11:46,032 --> 00:11:48,814
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

163
00:11:49,263 --> 00:11:51,168
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

164
00:11:51,168 --> 00:11:57,199
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

165
00:11:57,781 --> 00:12:01,664
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

166
00:12:01,664 --> 00:12:04,889
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

167
00:12:05,401 --> 00:12:08,000
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

168
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:13,128
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

169
00:12:13,128 --> 00:12:16,656
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

170
00:12:16,656 --> 00:12:20,364
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

171
00:12:20,364 --> 00:12:22,256
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

172
00:12:22,256 --> 00:12:24,333
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

173
00:12:24,333 --> 00:12:26,864
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

174
00:12:26,864 --> 00:12:30,901
♪You met the most precious person♪

175
00:12:32,569 --> 00:12:34,432
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

176
00:12:34,432 --> 00:12:36,951
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

177
00:12:36,951 --> 00:12:38,400
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

178
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:40,702
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

179
00:12:40,702 --> 00:12:42,672
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

180
00:12:42,672 --> 00:12:47,082
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

181
00:12:47,082 --> 00:12:48,624
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

182
00:12:48,624 --> 00:12:50,534
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

183
00:12:50,534 --> 00:12:53,808
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

184
00:12:53,808 --> 00:12:57,129
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

185
00:12:57,129 --> 00:12:58,864
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

186
00:12:58,864 --> 00:13:03,488
♪Just catch your breath first♪

187
00:13:03,488 --> 00:13:07,238
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

188
00:13:07,238 --> 00:13:10,616
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

189
00:13:10,990 --> 00:13:12,960
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

190
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:18,707
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

191
00:13:18,707 --> 00:13:22,223
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

192
00:13:22,223 --> 00:13:23,792
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

193
00:13:23,792 --> 00:13:26,102
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

194
00:13:26,102 --> 00:13:27,840
♪From laughter to devotion♪

195
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,896
♪From falling to innocence♪

196
00:13:29,896 --> 00:13:31,744
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

197
00:13:31,744 --> 00:13:38,414
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
